.TH SDE-DISPLAY-SETTINGS 1 "October 2026" "SDE Alpha" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sde-display-settings \- native monitor and display profile settings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-display-settings
.RI [ --version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure X11 RandR displays, resolution, refresh rate, rotation, main display,
position and hardware-matched profiles. Drag monitors or enter pixel positions.
Detect refreshes hardware; topology changes are also detected while running.
.PP
Apply tests for 15 seconds. Keep Changes saves the layout. Revert, timeout or
application termination restores the previous layout via an independent worker.
.PP
Interface scale changes shared SDE and GTK text DPI, not pixel resolution.
Available sizes are 100, 125, 150, 175 and 200 percent. Some clients need reopening.
This X11 backend does not implement independent fractional scale per monitor.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/sde/display-profiles/
.br
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
